# Must match apps/api so cookies signed by the API are valid in this app
# (the proxy uses @repo/auth's getSession to validate the cookie locally).
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=

# Auth is SAME-ORIGIN by default: next.config.ts rewrites /api/auth/* to the
# auth service, so the session cookie stays first-party on this app's origin
# (`.localhost` hosts are a public suffix — no cookie domain is shareable
# across portless hosts). Set NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_URL only to OVERRIDE with a
# genuinely cross-origin auth deployment (e.g. prod auth on a sibling
# subdomain that shares a registrable domain for cookies).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_URL=https://auth.qolmeia.ai

# Where the /api/auth/* rewrite proxies to, server-to-server.
# AUTH_SERVICE_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
